# CurseForge's packager: the root is the Cabbie add-on, and the five map add-ons move out beside it.
package-as: Cabbie

manual-changelog: CHANGELOG.md

move-folders:
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_EK: Cabbie_Data_EK
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Zephras: Cabbie_Data_Zephras
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Landmarks_EK: Cabbie_Landmarks_EK
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Landmarks_Kalimdor: Cabbie_Landmarks_Kalimdor

ignore:
  - README.md
